  "title": "Tata Motors Expands EV Market Share Amid Strong Demand and Production Constraints",
  "summary": "Tata Motors has gained significant market share in the electric vehicle segment, with bookings tripling over the last six months and production capacity facing constraints. The company expects demand for its electric commercial vehicles (CVs) to remain strong, with a focus on addressing supply chain bottlenecks.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Tata Motors increased EV bookings by 3x in the last six months, despite production limitations.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The company expects strong demand for electric CVs and expects to resolve supply chain bottlenecks by the end of the quarter.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Tata Motors reported over 3,400 electric commercial vehicle orders in the first quarter of FY27.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
